  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup butter, softened",
    "1 cup white sugar",
    "1 (8 ounce) package cream cheese, softened",
    "1 egg",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "2.25 cups all-purpose flour",
    "1 (3 ounce) package instant pistachio pudding mix",
    "1 teaspoon baking powder",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "3 (1 ounce) squares semisweet chocolate",
    "1 teaspoon shortening"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Wf8T8-9ZYq-2QM4Oz2TvhEA7QMs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/10948-pistachio-cream-cheese-fingers-VAT-005-step-01-9ed52470f6e04f0680030a9f895021ed.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/10948/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a large bowl, cream together the butter, sugar, and cream cheese until light and fluffy. Beat in the egg and vanilla.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/87Cx39l-0GJCsp-FT5XENC3t_jc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/10948-pistachio-cream-cheese-fingers-VAT-006-step-02-667ee9fd33c14a7d9959f1d3039018fe.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/10948/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine the flour, dry pudding mix, baking powder, and salt; stir into the creamed mixture. Cover dough, and refrigerate for at least one hour for easier handling.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/AlFHX6w3ibRjemYyUatdJqKzkYo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/10948-pistachio-cream-cheese-fingers-VAT-007-step-03-ce9a6466ec0f4fa1b13e7efd793dc6b1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/10948/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease cookie sheets. Shape teaspoonfuls of dough into finger shapes, about 1 1/2 inches long. Place cookies on prepared cookie sheets.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/dKjVA-ZLpMz_feIN3teD-WGm314=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/10948-pistachio-cream-cheese-fingers-VAT-008-step-04-c0e35f2267db47d1b91f521291f1822a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/10948/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake for 9 to 12 minutes in the preheated oven, or until set and very lightly browned on bottoms. Cool completely on a wire rack.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/nhhMwjlbiNTF5cjDo6lZK_yBjHQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/10948-pistachio-cream-cheese-fingers-VAT-009-step-05-6a97b9d2c3f5497f8a09f2a336641ce4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/10948/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "In small saucepan over low heat, melt together chocolate and shortening, stirring constantly until smooth and well blended.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/JA6i-67XCOo-Ac17FK_xg1qD8yE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/10948-pistachio-cream-cheese-fingers-VAT-010-step-06-6f5925b1e2374a0d8e6705ace564a8ef.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/10948/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drizzle a small amount of chocolate over each cookie. Allow the chocolate to set before storing.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/AeBUrsk-FbxXukS1-LROiy5TH5k=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/10948-pistachio-cream-cheese-fingers-VAT-011-step-07-65cef2a6a6c54de2a62f33798e4a8402.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/10948/step_07.webp"
    }
  ],
